"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226210/e2aace4b6e94bdef0eb491f6dfd6a498de45152b/ss_e2aace4b6e94bdef0eb491f6dfd6a498de45152b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773688455","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226210/e2aace4b6e94bdef0eb491f6dfd6a498de45152b/ss_e2aace4b6e94bdef0eb491f6dfd6a498de45152b.600x338.jpg?t=1773688455"}],"short_description":"You're a skeleton shopkeep who hires adventurers to collect loot for you after your untimely demise. Send adventurers into battle, sell what they find, and build up your town in this laid-back idle game!","steam_appid":3226210,"support_info":{"email":"adam@skeleseller.com","url":"https://skeleseller.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://skeleseller.com/"}